    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda lwa ng'wa Isakaali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isakaali walī na bitūnja banè: Toola, Pua, Yashubu, na Simuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Toola baalī: Uzi, Lefaiya, Yelieli, Yahimai, Ibusamu, na Sang'weli; a benaba baalī batongeeji ū mu ndūgū. Ū mu shikū ja būsugi wa ng'wa Daūdi, a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Toola abo baalī bamanīkile gīkī balī bagosha bapandile ha sī ū mu mihayo ya būlūgū, baalī shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shibīlī na magana atandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Uzi walī na ng'witūnja witanagwa Iziha. A bitūnja ba ng'wa Iziha baalī: Mikaeli, Obadia, Yoeli, na Ishiha; a bose būtanò wabo baalī batongeeji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shibyalīlwe shabo shaalī shoolekije gīkī ū mu ndūgū jabo baalī na banhū shihūmbī makūmi adatū na shitandatū abo baalī badūgije kwilwisha mu būlūgū, nguno baalī na mhalī ja bakīma bingī; na a baana baalī babyala bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ndūgū jose ja mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Isakaali abo baalī bamanīīkile gīkī badūgije kwingīla mu būlūgū, na baalī bandīkilwe būlī bene mu numba yabo, baalī shihūmbī makūmi anaane na mpungatī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Benjamini walī na bitūnja badatū: Bela, Beka na Yedaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Bela baalī: Eziboni, Uzi, Uzieli, Yelimoti na Ili; banhū batanò, būlī ng'wene walī ntongeeji ū mu numba ya ng'wawe. Ū mu ndūgū jabo baalī bandīkilwe banhū shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shibīlī, na makūmi adatū na banè, abo baalī badūgije kwingīla mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Beka baalī: Zemila, Yoashi, Elieza, Elionai, Omuli, Yelemoti, Abiya, Anasosi na Alemeti. A bose benaba baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Beka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya shibyalīlwe shabo īyo yalī yandīkilwe yoolekejaga batongeeji babo, hamò na banhū shihūmbī makūmi abīlī, na magana abīlī abo baalī badūgije kūlwa mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yedaeli walī Bilihani: A bitūnja ba ng'wa Bilihani baalī: Yeushi, Benjamini, Ehudi, Kenaana, Zeetani, Talishishi na Ahishaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yedaeli benaba a bose baalī batongeeji ba ndūgū jabo. Baalī na banhū shihūmbī ikūmi na mpungatī na magana abīlī abo baalī badūgije kwingīla mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ili a bitūnja bakwe baalī: Shupimu na Hupimu. Ū Hushimu ng'wene walī ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Aheeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda lwa ng'wa Nafutaali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Nafutaali baalī: Yahizieli, Guni, Yezeeli, Shalumu; A benaba baalī ba mpanda gwa ng'wa Biliha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Manase baalī: Asilieli na Makili; akabyala kūfuma mulī nkīma wa Aalamu. Ū Makili ūmyala Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Makili h'ūyo akabapandīkīla bakīma a ba Hupimu nū Shupimu. Walī n'ilūmbū lyakwe witanagwa Maaka; hama walī na ndūgūye wa mu kaaya gete, ī lina lyakwe witanagwa Zelofeti. Ū ng'wene walī atabyalile a bitūnja, walī na bashīke dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Makili ū nke walī Maaka ī lina lyakwe; akabyala baana bagosha, ūmò ī lina lyakwe Peleshi, ū ūngī Sheleshi. Ū Sheleshi ūbyala bitūnja: Ulamu na Lakemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ulamu ūbyala ng'witūnja, lina lyakwe Bedaani. A benaba hū baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Gileadi, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Makili, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī n'ilūmbūye witanagwa Hamolekesi; akababyala ba Ishodi, Abieza, na Mahīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho na Shemida, a bitūnja bakwe baalī: Ahiani, Shekemu, Liki na Aniamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Efulaimu baalī: Shūsela, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Beledi, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Tahasi, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Eleada, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Tahasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Zabadi, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Shūsela. Baalīho bangī babīlī; Ezeeli na Eleadi, bakaja kū banhū ba Gaasi, a bajiga-jiga ba mu sī yenīyo, kūjūbasoja mitugo jabo; būūkabūlagīlwa kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū saabo ū Efulaimu akabalīla ikanza lya shikū ningī no, a badūgū bakwe biza kūnūngūja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī yenīyo ūlaala nū nke hangī, ūbūcha nda ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, ī lina ūng'wilīka Belia; nguno ū mu kaya yakwe gaalī gagwa mo makoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na nshīke wakwe witanagwa Sheela; ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūzenga mizengo ya Beti-holoni: gūmò kū ntulumenho, gūngī kū ngūlya; ūzenga na nzengo gwa Ūzeni-sheela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja wakwe walī Lefa, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Leshefu, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Teela, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Tahani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Ladani, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Amihudi, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Elishama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Nuni, nang'hwe walī na ng'witūnja Yoshwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī yabo na a mapandī gabo ga kwikala yalī kwandīja Beeseli na a magūngūli ayo gaalī gīpīndije, kūjīlīīla kīya Naalani. Ū kū ng'weli būshika Gezeeli, nayo hamò na a magūngūli gayo, hūna nī Aya hamò na a magūngūli gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū lūbīmbī ūlo baalī babīmbīkanilwe na sī ya banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase, yalīho mizengo ya: Beeti-shani, Taanaki, Megido, na Dooli, hamò na a magūngūli gayo. Ū mu mizengo yenīyī h'ūmo bikalaga a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Yosefu ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūganda Lwa Ng'wa Asheli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Asheli baalī: Imuna, Ishuva, na Beliya; baalī n'ilūmbū lyabo witanagwa Seela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Beliya baalī: Hebeeli, na Melikieli ūyo akmyala Bilizaiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hebeeli walī ise wa ba Yafuleti, Shomeeli na Hosamu, hamò na ilūmbū lyabo Shua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yafuleti baalī: Pasaki, Bimhalī, na Ashuvati. A benaba hū baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Yafuleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Shomeeli baalī: Ahi, Looga, Hūbba, na Aalamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wana wa ng'wawe ū Helemu baalī: Zofa, Imuna, Sheleshi, na Amaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Zofa baalī: Sua, Halinefa, Shuali, Beeli, Imula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beeza, Hoodi, Shama, Shilisha, Isilani na Beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yeseli baalī: Yefune, Pisipa na Ala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abitūnja ba ng'wa Ula baalī: Aala, Hanieli na Lizia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bose benaba baalī banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Asheli; banhū basolilwe kūbiza batongeeji ba ndūgū jabo, nguno baalī bashilikale bashisha-ng'holò, na ba būdūla mu milīmo. Ī lisaabu lya banhū abo baalī bandīkilwe ū mu ndūgū jabo, na badūgije kwingīla mu būlūgū lyalī shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shitandatū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
